/ locals: result
#sqf_result data-sqf-target="result"
  - if result.nil?
    .text-muted.small.text-center.py-2 Run some SQF to see the output.
  - elsif result.error.present?
    .alert.alert-danger.mb-0.py-2.small
      i.bi.bi-exclamation-triangle.me-1
      span.sqf-error-text = result.error
  - elsif result.output.present?
    .small.text-muted.mb-1 Returned
    .sqf-output-view data-controller="sqf-output" data-sqf-output-code-value=result.output.inspect
  - elsif result.returned_nothing
    .alert.alert-warning.mb-0.py-2.small
      i.bi.bi-question-circle.me-1
      | Ran, but nothing came back. It may be invalid, or the code may simply not return a value.
  - else
    .alert.alert-success.mb-0.py-2.small
      i.bi.bi-check-circle.me-1
      | Executed.
